        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wz3pdSQoHoB2gSx5RkJl2Y0sgBh\"><em><strong>The following table shows the number of people from five European nations living in each other&rsquo;s countries in 2011. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main features and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Europeans Living in Other Nations: 2011</em></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\"><em><span class=\"text-only\" data-eleid=\"34582860\">Xem livestream giải đề n&agrave;y c&ugrave;ng thầy Phạm Minh Khoa (<span style=\"color: rgb(224, 62, 45);\"><strong>2 lần 9.0</strong></span>) <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/live/3pygofebp9Q?si=L-Dio1Zs9Uaia_3s\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">tại đ&acirc;y bạn nh&eacute;!</a></span></span></em></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề + Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N64jd9FvgoRfDTx2p91lBNjJgRc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GSfZdFZOWo4qLSxeFS1lCO9Wggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JPpTdOky0o45Jxx6Vw0lN8Ckgdl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LT8pdhmIQoQrzWxh5UQlafCBgTw\">Bảng số liệu đề Europeans Living in Other Nations: 2011 m&ocirc; tả số lượng người nhập cư ở năm quốc gia ch&acirc;u &Acirc;u v&agrave;o năm 2011.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HEkZdVl0Loexrnx8bSzlHBRBg3D\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AENmd32dPoMrGZxIEABlAuMdgLc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-El90duJV1oc7FSxkMP9lgvB2gMc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BykJdR2XJoSQQOxI1XulpWSbgkg\">Overview m&igrave;nh sẽ so s&aacute;nh dữ liệu để lần lượt đưa ra c&aacute;c th&ocirc;ng tin tổng quan:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KQDYdABDCoKAWzxpWLslYR3qgQe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Anh v&agrave; Đức l&agrave; <strong>hai điểm đến được ưa chuộng nhất</strong> d&agrave;nh cho người nước ngo&agrave;i.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EhnBdlUA2oKyIHxxsTrli9AQgTb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ba Lan <strong>thu h&uacute;t &iacute;t người nhất từ bốn nước c&ograve;n lại</strong>, trong khi ngược lại, tổng số c&ocirc;ng d&acirc;n của họ sinh sống tại c&aacute;c nước kh&aacute;c lại cao nhất.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VGzOd4DCwoHl5Txwws8ldRtIgjh\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng ph&acirc;n chia 2 đoạn BODY</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KEbNd18N4ojAdxx5thflzyGzgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GjlKdTAFYotAH4xPyJTlzajigSd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T2zudxVgOoXjMpxhdoIlYPYsg4b\">Ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh chọn chia phần th&acirc;n b&agrave;i Europeans Living in Other Nations: 2011 <em>theo quốc gia:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NzYMdbgq5oCfQNxALbHlAsnegce\">+ <strong>[BODY 1 - c&aacute;c điểm đến phổ biến nhất]</strong>: Germany v&agrave; British</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QANrdhu4UopKClxy7eplT46ggEh\">+ <strong>[BODY 2 - c&aacute;c điểm đến &iacute;t phổ biến hơn]</strong>: Italy, Poland v&agrave; Spain</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TBLEdCzcBoTHpGxvoBBli2dZg5d\">+ <strong>[BODY 3 - Số liệu ri&ecirc;ng cho Total]</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TBLEdCzcBoTHpGxvoBBli2dZg5d\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Định hướng sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong từng BODY</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-APeudfcnGokeKfxzDvQl1ZTYg0b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YWd1dsUwQoILZ1xijNxlMAK4gNP\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G329dRKrdoXJBtxdtUPlH4Kzgqb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UDcwdkI6jooPsGx5cPhlQOPGgJd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>[BODY 1]</strong>: <strong>c&aacute;c điểm đến phổ biến nhất</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ASL4dtCteoX2CRxVyN9lZJL0ghf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh tổng số người nhập cư</strong> giữa Germany <em>(1.2 million)</em> v&agrave; British <em>(1 million)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S1WYd8vY0opWvmxZSFClmnmGg1d\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) <strong>Th&ocirc;ng tin chi tiết về Germany</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WNxQdQ8CxocFHLxe9GTlNVCugXe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 3) <strong>Th&ocirc;ng tin chi tiết về British</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9EjdhjKdoozdtxzF7AlN1bZgtd\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ThkRdpBqAo7SG2xOaYXlWbHcgNh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>[BODY 2]</strong>: <strong>c&aacute;c điểm đến &iacute;t phổ biến hơn</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JmCHdVnMco3cEtxpgI8lloNXgve\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) <strong>So s&aacute;nh tổng số người nhập cư</strong> giữa Spain <em>(861,000)</em> v&agrave; Italy <em>(196,000)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BvXudsJEToM95ZxvOullNpQqgsh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) <strong>Th&ocirc;ng tin chi tiết về Spain</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NxiDdQzrHoAWpIxnosUlpcPpgBb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 3) <strong>Th&ocirc;ng tin chi tiết về Italy</strong></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RoCRd2fRrospAUxkHbLl4bYfgHb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 4) <strong>Th&ocirc;ng tin to&agrave;n diện về Poland</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JlPdd8sBxoF9p7xMHfJlFdIugkb\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YnYadc7ldo6gFFxHhEsl4tHVgOh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>[BODY 3]</strong>: <strong>th&ocirc;ng tin về total , tổng kết số liệu</strong></span></h4>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BEjndvYfvohGtYxLXkClrLn2gTg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 1) <strong>Tổng số người nhập cư</strong>: 3.3 million</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QwtedaYCToxqk0xLcnslvlb2gUd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 2) <strong>So s&aacute;nh giữa 2 nh&oacute;m lớn nhất:</strong> Poland <em>(1,168,000)</em> v&agrave; Italy <em>(863,670)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B9fddKDmYoAsa1xQosZlXTDOgne\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(C&acirc;u 3) <strong>So s&aacute;nh c&aacute;c nước c&ograve;n lại: </strong>Spain thấp nhất <em>(202,170), British v&agrave; Germany tương đương (tr&ecirc;n 500,000)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Định hướng về cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C&aacute;c bạn c&oacute; thể tham khảo cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u sau đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZD6tdIMdCoiL2cxB0EqlkTEPgnf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div>\n<table class=\"ace-table\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"213;305;423\"><colgroup><col width=\"213\"><col width=\"305\"><col width=\"423\"></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Cy0bdQC0foBkZxxfn7tl3T5mgac\"><strong>Chức năng</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQdEd4hDnoW5sixqOqulihpWgqE\"><strong>Cấu tr&uacute;c</strong></div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Vc3VdWJdwohUVgxXJcyluVzYgah\"><strong>V&iacute; dụ</strong></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NkUAdDuYSonSexxzYHilefX6gJb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>So s&aacute;nh số lượng</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MzzAd4bYfou9ttxiHwUlU6Geg5g\">Tả số liệu X compared to + số liệu Y</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HdWTd2Uv3oCRFyxhh1KlqjRPgCf\">Germany was home to nearly 1.2 million expatriates, <strong>compared to</strong> over 1 million in Britain</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DMJ1dQvkFoeuIJxkPQVltiK0g9e\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>M&ocirc; tả số liệu gấp đ&ocirc;i/ gấp ba</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZOVdTLIgohcsoxKqENltgOegqc\">Be twice + NOUN</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T8GLdo9evodYQjx7fUClPcWOggb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Fxkbd0hjuo2QvoxfP9SldRWKgsb\">Spain was the preferred country for British immigrants, with 391,000, <strong>nearly twice</strong> <strong>the numbers of Germans and Italians </strong>(around 200,000 each)</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" start=\"3\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A1B9dWcIYomTe0xec8Clae83gld\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>So s&aacute;nh phạm vi</strong></div>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: justify;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UrkZdYKmmoNHwvxEM5HlooFWgKc\">Range from X to Y</div>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RR5jdclXcoHAEUx39HUl46NHgqe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The figures for Spaniards and Italians residing there were significantly smaller, with populations <strong>ranging from 71,000 to 119,000. </strong></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
